            "heading": "Objects Built Around a Way of Living",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Born in Nepal, Toit Studio began with a simple idea, everyday objects should feel considered, useful, and personal. Inspired by the way we gather, cook, share, and live, we curate homeware that brings warmth and character to everyday moments.</p><p>From drinkware and tableware to kitchenware and décor, each piece is selected with intention, designed to be enjoyed often, live beautifully in your home, and last beyond the moment.</p><p><em>“Clarity, considered materials, human empathy, and lasting strength guide everything we create and how we do business.”</em></p><p>– Pragya, Founder</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
